From: Agathe Porte <agathe.porte@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:57:02 +0000
Subject: meson.build: bump meson_version to 0.61

During the build meson warns that the specified minimum meson version
does not match the features used during the build; bump meson_version
to the higher required version which is 0.61.0 for install_symlink.

Forwarded: https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/gbm-msm-backend/pull/30
Signed-off-by: Agathe Porte <agathe.porte@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 7c3e6b5..db7a96e 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ project('libgbm-msm', 'c',
           'c_std=gnu99',
           'warning_level=1',
         ],
-        meson_version : '>= 0.50'
+        meson_version : '>= 0.61'
 )
 
 cc = meson.get_compiler('c')
